# PitchPerfect Environment Variables
# ==================================================

# ==================================================
# BACKEND API (REQUIRED for AI features)
# ==================================================

# URL of the PitchPerfect backend API server
# For development: http://localhost:3001
# For production: Your deployed backend URL (e.g., https://api.pitchperfect.app)
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001

# ==================================================
# ARCHITECTURE NOTE
# ==================================================

# API keys (Anthropic, ElevenLabs) are now stored ONLY on the backend server.
# This is a security best practice - never expose API keys in client-side code.
#
# To set up the backend:
# 1. cd backend/
# 2. cp .env.example .env
# 3. Add your API keys to backend/.env
# 4. npm install && npm run dev
#
# The app will automatically authenticate with the backend and route all
# AI requests through it securely.

# ==================================================
# DEVELOPMENT SETUP
# ==================================================

# 1. Start the backend server (in a separate terminal):
#    cd backend && npm run dev
#
# 2. Start the React Native app:
#    npm start
#
# The app will connect to the backend at EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL

# ==================================================
# PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT
# ==================================================

# 1. Deploy the backend to Railway/Render/Vercel:
#    - Set environment variables (API keys, JWT secret)
#    - Deploy from /backend directory
#
# 2. Update EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL to your production backend URL
#
# 3. Build and deploy the app through EAS

# ==================================================
# LEGACY KEYS (DO NOT USE)
# ==================================================

# These keys were previously used for direct API calls.
# They should NOT be set - all API calls now go through the backend.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY - REMOVED (use backend)
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ELEVENLABS_API_KEY - REMOVED (use backend)
